  "title": "TRX Gold Reports Q3 2026 Production on Record Throughput, Reaffirms Guidance, and Accelerates Plant Expansion",
  "summary": "TORONTO, Ontario, June 5, 2026 – TRX Gold Corporation (TSX: TRX) (NYSE American: TRX) (the “Company” or “TRX Gold”) is pleased to announce preliminary results for Q3 2026¹. Stephen Mullowney, TRX Gold CEO commented: “Q3 2026 was a defining quarter for the Company as we delivered record plant throughput and improved recoveries, which drove strong production and a record buildup […]",
